{"unit_id":"tag:06PJ:proof","translation":"先假设<MATH_0001>满足（1）和（2）。性质（1）\n说明<MATH_0002>为等价（equivalence），参见\n《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》\n引理<REF_0001>。\n由定理<REF_0002>，\n商叠（quotient stack）<MATH_0003>是代数栈（algebraic stack）。因此\n<MATH_0004>也为代数栈（algebraic stack），参见\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0003>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n反过来，假设<MATH_0005>为代数栈（algebraic stack）。可选取\n概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>和满射（surjective）、光滑（smooth）的<MATH_0007>-态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0008>。\n由<MATH_0009>-米田引理（Yoneda lemma）\n（《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》第<REF_0004>节），\n它对应于对象（object）<MATH_0010>，后者属于<MATH_0011>在<MATH_0012>上的纤维。\n由对<MATH_0013>的描述，见《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》引理<REF_0005>，\n可找到满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）、局部有限表示（finitely presented）的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0014>，其源靶为概形（schemes），使得<MATH_0015>对应于态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0016>。注意，<MATH_0017>-态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0018>\n对应于<MATH_0019>，它满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation），\n参见\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》引理\n<REF_0006>。\n因此\n<MATH_0020>，\n它由代数空间（algebraic space）\n<MATH_0021>\n表示\n（第一个等式见\n《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》引理\n<REF_0007>；\n第二个等式为限制（restriction）的定义），\n在<MATH_0022>上通过<MATH_0023>与<MATH_0024>二者平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）\n（由基变换（base change）得到，参见\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》引理\n<REF_0008>）。\n由<MATH_0025>的这一描述及\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0009>，\n得到典范（canonical）的全忠实（fully faithful）<MATH_0026>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0027>。\n此<MATH_0028>-态射（morphism）本质满射（essentially surjective），因为<MATH_0029>平坦（flat）、\n局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）且满射（surjective）（参见\n《叠（Stacks）》引理<REF_0010>）；\n另一种证明方法是使用\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》注记\n<REF_0011>。\n最后，使用\n《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》引理\n<REF_0012>，\n可知合成（composition）\n<MATH_0030>是层（sheaves）的满射（surjection）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Yoneda lemma","target_term":"米田引理"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"essentially surjective","target_term":"本质满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Stacks","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"Yoneda lemma","target_term":"米田引理","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"essentially surjective","target_term":"本质满射","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"Stacks","target_term":"叠","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"合成","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"06PJ：待决"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射","context":"06PJ：待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06PK:proof","translation":"本引理是引理<REF_0001>的特殊情形。\n具体说来，商叠（quotient stack）<MATH_0001>由\n《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》定义<REF_0002>\n等于商叠（quotient stack）<MATH_0002>，后者属于代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的群胚（groupoid）<MATH_0003>，该群胚与\n《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》引理<REF_0003>中的群作用（group action）关联。\n为得到条件（1），需要一个小观察。\n具体说来，态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是第二个投影（projection），\n而态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>是作用（action）态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>。\n因此，态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，来自引理<REF_0004>，\n在当前情形下对应于态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0008>。\n但是，<MATH_0009>的逆（inverse）给出对称性，因此这个态射（morphism）同构（isomorphic）于引理陈述中的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0010>。\n细节略。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"group action","target_term":"群作用"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠","context":"06PK：待决"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"06PK：引用章节"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"06PK：待决"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚","context":"06PK：待决"},{"source_term":"group action","target_term":"群作用","context":"06PK：待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"06PK：待决"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影","context":"06PK：待决"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用","context":"06PK：待决"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"06PK：待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"06PK：待决"}],"notes":["来源目录把 small observation 中的普通形容词 small 盘点为数学术语；保持忠实译文，待独立来源普通用法政策登记，不将其假报为数学术语。"]}
